     <td style=\"width:400px;\">\n              \n      <img height=\"auto\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/msgsndr/oKvxmpgImkZb3TwM9ii4/media/667c7b5ab458d55a15346991.jpeg\" style=\"border:0;display:block;outline:none;text-decoration:none;height:auto;width:100%;font-size:13px;\" width=\"400\" countdown-timer-hide-for-apple-mail=\"false\">\n    \n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n          </tbody>\n\n        </table>\n    \n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n      </div>\n    \n          <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:600px;\" width=\"600\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" ><tr><td style=\"line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\"><![endif]-->\n    \n      \n     \n    <div style=\"overflow:hidden;\">\n      <div style=\"background:#ffffff;background-color:#ffffff;border-width:0px;margin:0px auto 0px auto;border-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;max-width:600px;\">\n        \n        <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background:#ffffff;background-color:#ffffff;width:100%;border-radius:0px;\">\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td style=\"padding:20px 0;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-top:10px;border-color:transparent;direction:ltr;font-size:0px;text-align:center;\">\n                <!--[if mso | IE]><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:top;width:560px;\" ><![endif]-->\n            \n      <div class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\">\n        \n      <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;\">\n              \n    <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"\" width=\"100%\">\n          <tbody>\n            \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"center\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <p style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:100%;\">\n      </p>\n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:520px;\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"520px\" ><tr><td style=\"height:0;line-height:0;\"> &nbsp;\n</td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n    \n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <div style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;text-align:left;color:#000000;\"><h2 style=\"margin-top: 14pt;margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The Problem with \u201cPassive Income\u201d Plumbing Companies</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Hi Sara,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">If you\u2019ve been on YouTube in the last six months, you\u2019ve probably seen it: another glossy video telling you that buying a \u201cboring\u201d business (think HVAC, plumbing, car washes) is your ticket to sipping champagne on a yacht while your new company runs itself.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">Let\u2019s burst that bubble\u2014gently, but thoroughly. Spoiler alert: there\u2019s nothing \u201cpassive\u201d about clogged toilets and broken soap dispensers.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\"><strong>Here\u2019s the Not-So-Boring Truth:</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">These businesses aren\u2019t bad buys\u2014in fact, they can be excellent ones\u2014but they are people-heavy, compliance-laden, and deeply operational.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">You want to run a car wash? Fantastic. Just know that someone\u2019s going to have to restock soap, clean up after messy customers, and handle complaints from people convinced your very expensive machinery scratched their 2002 Honda Civic.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">You want to buy an HVAC business with zero experience in HVAC? I love your optimism. But unless you\u2019re a professional management company with a team ready to run the business for you, prepare for a crash course in employee drama, regulatory headaches, and insurance chaos.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\"><strong>Here\u2019s Why People Sell These \u201cCash Cows\u201d:</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">Because they\u2019re tired. Because they\u2019ve been in the trenches dealing with payroll, collections, broken equipment, and burnt-out technicians. Buying one of these businesses isn\u2019t a walk in the park\u2014it\u2019s a full sprint through a people-powered obstacle course.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\"><strong>So, Should You Buy One?</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">Maybe! If you\u2019ve got the grit, the systems, and the support, it can be a profitable ride.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">But here\u2019s an insider tip: accounting practices are flying under the radar right now. </span><br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">They\u2019ve got:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">Great margins (sometimes 30-40%!)</span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">Clean books (literally their job)</span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: disc;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">Less red tape (particularly if you\u2019re buying a non-attest firm)</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">We\u2019ve got more on this at Deal Academy, where we walk you through how to spot the right opportunities and avoid the common pitfalls that turn dream deals into disasters.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">Want to learn how to buy a business without buying a headache?</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/b02e832aec2?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\"><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204); color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-size: 14px\"><u>Check out our courses</u></span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\"> and stay tuned\u2014we\u2019re doing a deep dive soon on how to evaluate and acquire accounting firms the smart way.</span><br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">To actually boring (and profitable) businesses,<br>Sara Sharp<br>Partner, SK&amp;S Law Group<br>Founder, Deal Academy</span></p></div>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <div style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;text-align:left;color:#000000;\"><p>For more helpful lessons from Deal Academy, check out our <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/b2345ec4a57?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\">Dealmakers Youtube Channel </span></a>where you'll find Sara's <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/26f27dd07d8?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn&amp;v=csIoWCXhXsE&amp;t=15s\" title=\"Weekly Wine Down\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\">Weekly Wine Down,</span></a> where she talks about what she's seen in the industry this week and interviews with M&amp;A Experts and Dealmakers.</p><p>You can check out some recent Dealmakers YouTube videos by clicking the images below.</p></div>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"full\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing